{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The photos below are from the next update, which will appear soon. Thank you and we are\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 counting on your support in Early Access.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Welcome to The One. A post-apocalyptic survival game created by two\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 independent developers. </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong> </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Find food or grow your own.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840690/extras/ZYw.gif?t=1739381806\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore the open world, searching for items that will help you survive in this\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0crazy zombie world.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840690/extras/Loot.gif?t=1739381806\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Cut down trees, extract raw materials.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840690/extras/sur.gif?t=1739381806\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build your shelter.</strong>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840690/extras/bud.gif?t=1739381806\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>  Complete tasks to